# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Vulkan tests.
#
# Allocations made inside the Vulkan loader or the driver it loads. lavapipe
# keeps a little memory (128 bytes in vkCreateInstance, Mesa 26) after
# vkDestroyInstance. The driver is unloaded before the report, so its own
# frames have no name; the loader's frame below them is what matches.
# Our own allocations never have the loader in their stack, so they are
# still reported.
leak:libvulkan.so
